sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P1 as Phone 1
  participant S as Server
  participant P2 as Phone 2
  Note over P1,P2: both offline · both edit one booking
  P1->>P1: note = "Lunch"
  P2->>P2: note = "Dinner"
  Note over P1: online
  P1->>S: push "Lunch"
  S-->>P1: ok
  Note over P2: online
  P2->>S: push first: "Dinner"
  S-->>P2: ok · server now "Dinner"
  P2->>S: then pull
  S-->>P1: realtime nudge
  P1->>S: pull
  S-->>P1: "Dinner"
  Note over P1,P2: both show "Dinner" · the last push wins
